<div class="panel"><div class="panel-b" style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between"><div><strong>Start a session right now</strong><div class="muted small">Opens your host room immediately — like an instant Zoom or Teams meeting. Share the link and people can join in their browser.</div></div>
